OL,3,APassengers face airport delays as US
OL,4,Aflights resume after nationwide ground
OL,5,Astop
OL,6,
OL,7,FOfficials have blamed old systems for
OL,8,Fthe outage, saying this could happen
OL,9,Fagain without a "complete overhaul"
OL,11,FThe incident, which started at about
OL,12,F21:00 GMT on Friday and lasted about
OL,13,Ffour hours, was the largest ground stop
OL,14,Fin the US since the one after 11
OL,15,FSeptember 2001
